# Pairs with VisibilityMatchesDecision. The prepare fan-out collects its votes
# but stages no pending bucket, as a prepare acknowledged without being durably
# written would. Once the registry records commit there is nothing for the gate
# to surface, so a key of a committed saga reads at its pre-saga value until its
# terminal lands - the gate serving "did not commit" for a saga that did.
MODULE: VisibilityMatchesDecisionPrepareNotStaged
TARGET: VisibilityMatchesDecision
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: acknowledges a prepare without staging its pending bucket, so a committed key reads pre-saga
PERTURBS: PrepareTx

--- FIND
    /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![t] =
                  [k \in Keys |-> IF k \in Written(t) THEN "pending" ELSE pend[t][k]]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the participants ack, but no pending bucket is installed.
    /\ pend' = pend
--- END
